["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"aep","stream_identity":"01a0cae6-7e88-710c-8913-d70d29cb7b4c","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG789a59ace306a21e9c79d2a33c5736d31c86dbcf8e9045b5f943732244e83644","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/history-shows-a-removed-edge","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":1,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: A removed edge leaves a trace in the entity stores\n\n## Context\n\n`aep artifact unrelate` landed in 0.53.0. Over the markdown backend the removal is a journal entry\na reader can follow. Over SQLite and Postgres the edge is removed correctly, but nothing lands on\nthe source artifact, so `aep plan artifact history <id>` there shows no sign that an edge was ever\ntaken back.\n\nThe cause is narrow and named: `Identity::before` in `crates/plan/aep-backend-entity/src/lib.rs`\ntakes its inner command as `_inner` and so never sees `RemoveRelation`. After the edge is gone,\n`change_of_event` cannot recover the relation kind or the target from the stored\n`{\"command\":\"remove-relation\",\"relation\":\"rel-…\"}`, because the id it names no longer resolves. The\nnote has to be written at removal time, and `aep-backend-entity` cannot reach the vocabulary that\nwould describe it — it does not depend on `aep-backend-markdown`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`aep plan artifact history <id>` over a SQLite store names the removed edge's relation kind and\ntarget after an `unrelate`, and the assertion is a test in the backend conformance suite so both\nentity backends are held to it.\n","relations":[{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"draft","summary":"Identity::before never sees RemoveRelation, so history over SQLite and Postgres shows nothing for an unrelate.","title":"A removed edge leaves a trace in the entity stores"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"}},"id":"MIG789a59ace306a21e9c79d2a33c5736d31c86dbcf8e9045b5f943732244e83644","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":1,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG789a59ace306a21e9c79d2a33c5736d31c86dbcf8e9045b5f943732244e83644"]}]